DOMAIN: Analytical Marxism and the Functionalist Defense of Historical Materialism
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-09-11
PAPERS_FOUND: 22 total (High: 10, Medium: 12, Low: 0)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP (marxism-analytical), PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CrossRef
